    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22403" root="شظى" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَنْظَاةٌ</span></b>  The <i>head,</i> or <i>top, of a mountain,</i> (K,
TA,) [and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَظِيَّةٌ</span></b> , (Freytag, from the Deewán
of the Hudhalees,)] <i>resembling the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُرْفَة</span> [q. v.]

<i>of a mosque:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَنَاظٍ</span>: and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجِبَالِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَوَاظِى</span></b> 
[likewise] signifies <i>the heads,</i> or <i>tops, of the
mountains.</i> (TA.)

